# Generated experiment artifacts (large / regenerable).
# These paths are ignored wholesale, but selected files under them are tracked
# via `git add -f` and stay tracked once added:
#   - reports, manifests and figure-generating scripts
#   - the CSV/parquet aggregates the thesis figures read
#     (experiments/analysis/output/**) — without them no results figure
#     rebuilds without the full external run archive; see docs/DATA.md
#   - experiments/HS-01/pool_frozen/{itempool.json,POOL_README.md}, which
#     analysis/hs01 needs; the stimulus PNGs beside them stay ignored because
#     they are ImageNet-derived and cannot be redistributed
runs/
experiments/analysis/output/
experiments/HS-01/data_raw/
experiments/HS-01/pool_frozen/
experiments/HS-01/pool_staging/
